WEBVTT

00:11.510 --> 00:13.390
It has been a few months since I came

00:12.710 --> 00:15.250
[Year 1901]

00:13.640 --> 00:15.910
to China from Italy to study the Grand Canal.

00:16.390 --> 00:17.230
Today,

00:17.230 --> 00:20.950
as I was lifted into the air in a hanging basket

00:21.190 --> 00:22.750
before the gates of Wuxi,

00:22.750 --> 00:24.320
I felt for the first time what it was like

00:24.320 --> 00:27.670
to rise above the world of smoke and fire.

00:28.110 --> 00:29.110
It's also here that

00:29.110 --> 00:30.780
I met my Chinese translator,

00:30.780 --> 00:32.030
Xie Pingyao.

00:32.189 --> 00:34.940
He will go northward with me

00:34.950 --> 00:37.870
and start our journey on the canal.

00:42.750 --> 00:44.190
You, the one wearing the red hat!

00:44.610 --> 00:45.930
Add five cents more!

00:45.950 --> 00:48.910
Pull me up! I'm stuck!

00:50.910 --> 00:53.960
Who let them stop? Wait!

00:54.380 --> 00:55.800
They want more money.

00:55.860 --> 00:58.440
Otherwise, they won't pull you up.

01:22.310 --> 01:23.910
This thousand-year-old canal

01:24.760 --> 01:26.280
carries the enduring history and cultural legacy

01:26.310 --> 01:28.190
of the Chinese civilization.

01:29.100 --> 01:30.700
It has nurtured and enriched

01:30.730 --> 01:33.420
the lives of countless families living by the canal.

01:34.460 --> 01:36.740
Ships traveling north and south

01:36.900 --> 01:39.060
carry memories that span across the ages.

01:39.390 --> 01:42.020
For people living by the canal,

01:42.670 --> 01:45.070
the canal is more than just a waterway.

01:45.100 --> 01:46.770
It's also a compass,

01:46.789 --> 01:49.110
pointing the way to the world.

01:49.539 --> 01:53.509
The canal is their vanguard in discovering the world.

01:54.229 --> 01:55.900
It stands for them,

01:55.920 --> 01:57.210
and journeys in their place

01:57.240 --> 02:00.080
to a wider and more expansive world.

02:01.120 --> 02:04.840
The canal even signifies

02:04.850 --> 02:06.610
their entire lives.

03:43.920 --> 03:47.400
[NORTHWARD]

03:47.540 --> 03:49.310
[Episode 1]

03:50.720 --> 03:53.340
[Year 2000]

03:54.329 --> 03:55.829
In the year 2000,

03:56.190 --> 03:58.600
as the new millennium arrived,

03:58.890 --> 04:00.770
the children living by the canal

04:00.790 --> 04:04.330
may still struggle to discern between the directions.

04:04.380 --> 04:06.610
However, they had already begun to know that

04:06.630 --> 04:08.680
if one heads left at the end of the bridge,

04:08.710 --> 04:10.980
it leads to the Forbidden City, the Great Wall,

04:11.010 --> 04:12.790
and Quanjude roast duck.

04:13.170 --> 04:14.120
If one heads right,

04:14.160 --> 04:17.160
it leads to the dazzling neon lights of Nanjing Road

04:17.180 --> 04:19.399
and White Rabbit candy.

04:19.430 --> 04:20.500
If one heads down,

04:20.529 --> 04:24.900
there will be an endless supply of free watermelon.

04:30.150 --> 04:31.910
The ship is here!

04:35.350 --> 04:36.960
Hurry! Run!

04:37.480 --> 04:38.190
Hurry up!

04:38.220 --> 04:39.210
Haikuo, get ready.

04:39.270 --> 04:40.040
Okay!

04:43.230 --> 04:44.060
Hurry, run!

04:44.060 --> 04:44.990
I know, I know.

04:44.990 --> 04:46.150
Xie Wanghe, hurry up!

04:46.150 --> 04:46.790
Got it.

04:46.790 --> 04:48.150
Shao Xingchi, you're the slowest.

04:48.150 --> 04:48.790
Come on, hurry!

04:48.790 --> 04:49.270
Wait for me.

04:49.270 --> 04:50.570
The ship is here, hurry up.

04:50.790 --> 04:52.790
-Xie Wanghe!
-Hurry up!

04:53.020 --> 04:53.950
Hurry up!

04:53.950 --> 04:54.909
Xingchi, hurry up.

04:56.480 --> 04:57.850
Shao Xingchi, hurry up!

04:57.950 --> 04:58.830
Hurry!

04:58.830 --> 04:59.590
The ship is here.

04:59.590 --> 05:00.360
Hurry up.

05:00.510 --> 05:01.350
Hurry, hurry!

05:01.350 --> 05:02.120
Stop nagging.

05:02.120 --> 05:03.110
Go watch the ship.

05:09.670 --> 05:10.810
Get ready!

05:24.200 --> 05:25.180
Jump!

05:48.110 --> 05:49.390
Run!

05:49.510 --> 05:50.620
Run!

05:50.620 --> 05:51.630
You brats!

05:51.860 --> 05:52.870
Do you want to die?

05:53.030 --> 05:54.350
Put down my watermelons!

05:54.470 --> 05:56.050
Xingchi, run!

05:56.950 --> 05:58.170
Run! Quick!

05:59.159 --> 06:00.460
My watermelons!

06:00.680 --> 06:02.750
Don't you jump!

06:02.950 --> 06:04.250
Do you want to die?

06:15.270 --> 06:16.550
I know you!

06:16.670 --> 06:18.310
You're Boss Xie's son!

06:18.500 --> 06:19.410
Later,

06:19.650 --> 06:22.910
I'll tell your dad to punish you!

06:23.580 --> 06:25.560
If you dare to steal my watermelons,

06:27.510 --> 06:30.540
I'll make sure to skin you alive!

06:31.360 --> 06:32.600
My name is Fenghua.

06:32.630 --> 06:34.190
This is the ten-year-old me.

06:34.250 --> 06:36.880
As you can see, my baby teeth have yet to fully fall out.

06:37.030 --> 06:38.430
The ones running ahead

06:38.460 --> 06:40.330
are my neighbors,

06:40.370 --> 06:44.510
Xie Wanghe, Shao Xingchi, and Zhou Haikuo.

06:44.530 --> 06:47.190
We all live on Flower Street.

06:47.710 --> 06:49.030
At that time,

06:49.050 --> 06:50.970
we were fooling around every day,

06:51.000 --> 06:53.290
and our little gang was well-known.

06:53.370 --> 06:55.010
We were excellent swimmers

06:55.040 --> 06:56.800
and notorious troublemakers.

06:56.850 --> 06:59.640
We were known for catching mussels and prawns, and stealing watermelons.

06:59.990 --> 07:01.070
Summer

07:01.090 --> 07:03.280
is our happiest time of the year.

07:03.840 --> 07:06.390
As the saying goes, with protection comes ease of mind.

07:06.680 --> 07:09.170
Under the protection of the canal and our families,

07:09.560 --> 07:11.200
our childhood days

07:11.260 --> 07:12.730
were carefree.

07:12.780 --> 07:15.860
It was like a beautiful dream.

07:15.080 --> 07:20.270
[Flower Street]

07:28.190 --> 07:29.110
Haihong!

07:29.990 --> 07:30.980
Haihong!

07:31.380 --> 07:32.740
Liang Haihong!

07:33.550 --> 07:34.590
Yes, Mr. Zhang?

07:34.640 --> 07:35.730
Haihong!

07:35.950 --> 07:37.230
Let me tell you something!

07:37.270 --> 07:37.920
What's wrong?

07:37.920 --> 07:40.470
Your brat stole my watermelons.

07:41.150 --> 07:43.230
He stole more than a dozen of them.

07:43.230 --> 07:44.230
I'm telling you,

07:44.230 --> 07:46.500
your son must take responsibility for this.

07:46.520 --> 07:47.310
Mr. Zhang.

07:47.310 --> 07:49.510
I understand. Please don't stay mad at the child.

07:49.510 --> 07:50.680
As for the payment for the watermelons,

07:50.680 --> 07:52.670
I'll bring it over with my eldest son later.

07:53.950 --> 07:56.590
The first bow is to heaven and earth.

08:00.600 --> 08:03.200
The second bow is to the parents.

08:04.670 --> 08:07.340
The couple bows to each other.

08:09.460 --> 08:12.140
The ceremony concludes.

08:18.680 --> 08:20.230
Hey, bride!

08:22.990 --> 08:24.590
The bride is so beautiful!

08:24.590 --> 08:26.730
When I grow up, I want to have my wedding on a ship too.

08:26.750 --> 08:28.890
You're talking as if you could even get married.

08:28.910 --> 08:29.930
If no one wants me,

08:29.930 --> 08:31.430
I'll marry Wanghe.

08:31.430 --> 08:32.309
I'll pass.

08:32.309 --> 08:33.350
You're a glutton.

08:33.350 --> 08:34.950
My family will go bankrupt from feeding you.

08:36.190 --> 08:37.220
What are you doing?

08:40.030 --> 08:40.830
Look.

08:40.960 --> 08:42.870
That's the groom and the bride.

08:42.870 --> 08:44.270
Isn't she pretty?

08:45.270 --> 08:46.320
Granny Ma!

08:46.360 --> 08:47.270
Granny Ma!

08:47.350 --> 08:49.230
Wanghe!

08:49.230 --> 08:50.590
Fenghua!

08:50.590 --> 08:51.790
Granny Ma!

08:54.670 --> 08:55.820
Slow down.

08:55.870 --> 08:58.070
Granny Ma!

08:58.070 --> 09:00.210
Look, they're here to greet you.

09:01.990 --> 09:04.610
Granny Ma.

09:04.630 --> 09:05.140
Granny Ma.

09:05.140 --> 09:06.550
Did you guys miss me?

09:06.590 --> 09:07.450
Granny Ma.

09:07.490 --> 09:08.020
Granny Ma.

09:08.220 --> 09:10.260
I've missed you too.

09:10.500 --> 09:11.680
Who is she?

09:11.750 --> 09:13.100
She's my granddaughter.

09:13.530 --> 09:15.090
Are you a foreigner?

09:15.270 --> 09:16.620
No way.

09:16.640 --> 09:18.160
Look at her face.

09:18.190 --> 09:19.430
Mixed-blood people look like this.

09:19.450 --> 09:21.250
I have seen some of them

09:21.280 --> 09:22.690
when they ate at my father's restaurant.

09:22.710 --> 09:23.500
Really?

09:23.760 --> 09:24.710
My name is Fenghua.

09:24.750 --> 09:25.550
What's your name?

09:25.910 --> 09:27.330
Ma Siyi.

09:27.400 --> 09:28.030
What?

09:28.070 --> 09:28.990
Louder, I can't hear you.

09:29.010 --> 09:30.960
Are you deaf? Her name is Ma Siyi.

09:31.610 --> 09:32.500
Okay.

09:32.940 --> 09:34.690
Hello, I'm Xie Wanghe.

09:34.910 --> 09:35.550
This is Zhou Haikuo.

09:35.570 --> 09:36.470
This is Shao Xingchi.

09:36.500 --> 09:38.140
-Hello. Hello.
-Hello. Hello.

09:38.300 --> 09:39.620
You can play the guitar?

09:39.640 --> 09:40.730
A little.

09:40.870 --> 09:42.570
Play it for us.

09:42.650 --> 09:43.830
This is my dad's guitar.

09:43.830 --> 09:44.950
Why can't I touch it?

09:44.950 --> 09:46.950
Go away. Go away.

09:47.560 --> 09:48.950
Let's go back.

09:51.050 --> 09:52.070
She's a girl.

09:52.110 --> 09:53.310
Don't run so fast!

09:53.470 --> 09:54.890
Let me carry the guitar case for you.

09:58.910 --> 09:59.590
You naughty boy!

09:59.590 --> 10:01.110
All you know is to run wild all day long.

10:01.130 --> 10:02.450
He's driving me crazy.

10:02.610 --> 10:03.930
Granny Ma is back.

10:03.980 --> 10:04.950
Granny Ma!

10:05.350 --> 10:06.070
This is...

10:06.120 --> 10:07.150
Siyi?

10:07.150 --> 10:07.590
Siyi!

10:07.630 --> 10:08.790
Look at this kid.

10:08.790 --> 10:09.270
Look.

10:09.270 --> 10:10.190
You've grown up.

10:10.230 --> 10:11.380
Right?

10:11.750 --> 10:13.110
You've grown so tall.

10:13.350 --> 10:15.110
Siyi, look.

10:15.150 --> 10:16.950
This is Aunt Liang,

10:17.120 --> 10:19.470
Aunt Yan, and Aunt Ling.

10:19.480 --> 10:21.210
Is she here for vacation?

10:22.780 --> 10:23.460
Yes.

10:24.390 --> 10:25.680
She's staying here for a while.

10:25.720 --> 10:27.030
Go on with your work.

10:27.080 --> 10:27.520
I'm leaving.

10:27.550 --> 10:29.530
Siyi, say goodbye to your aunties.

10:29.710 --> 10:30.460
Bye.

10:30.510 --> 10:31.350
Bye, Siyi.

10:31.350 --> 10:32.270
Go on with your work.

10:32.270 --> 10:32.960
Alright.

10:33.070 --> 10:34.550
Go back and rest.

10:34.550 --> 10:35.310
Don't worry about it.

10:35.310 --> 10:36.430
We're all here.

10:36.430 --> 10:37.950
Just tell us if you need anything.

10:37.950 --> 10:38.870
Okay.

10:38.870 --> 10:39.230
Be careful.

10:41.560 --> 10:42.680
Why did she bring

10:42.710 --> 10:44.400
the child back all of a sudden?

10:44.950 --> 10:46.950
She said the child would be staying for a while.

10:47.160 --> 10:49.360
What about the kid's mother?

10:50.920 --> 10:52.890
Didn't her daughter-in-law remarry?

10:52.920 --> 10:54.330
She just had a son.

10:54.800 --> 10:56.800
They must think

10:57.130 --> 10:58.380
the child's an eyesore.

11:00.450 --> 11:01.610
Slow down.

11:03.020 --> 11:04.900
They are quite mischievous.

11:04.920 --> 11:05.860
Siyi!

11:06.380 --> 11:07.320
Siyi.

11:07.580 --> 11:09.580
Siyi, come play with us.

11:09.580 --> 11:09.970
Yes.

11:09.990 --> 11:11.510
Let's go out and play.

11:11.540 --> 11:12.870
She's too tired today.

11:12.910 --> 11:14.270
She'll play with you tomorrow, okay?

11:14.390 --> 11:14.740
Okay.

11:14.830 --> 11:15.610
Okay.

11:15.630 --> 11:16.800
See you tomorrow.

11:16.830 --> 11:19.070
I'm making wontons for dinner, so come over and eat.

11:19.090 --> 11:19.940
Okay!

11:19.970 --> 11:21.020
Let's eat together.

11:25.550 --> 11:27.760
This is our home.

11:28.430 --> 11:29.760
Come in.

11:34.430 --> 11:35.360
Siyi.

11:36.530 --> 11:38.010
You must be tired today.

11:38.110 --> 11:39.950
I'll take you to school tomorrow

11:39.950 --> 11:41.150
for the procedures.

11:42.580 --> 11:45.050
Let me put your luggage in your room.

11:54.710 --> 11:57.500
It was a typical summer day when Siyi

11:57.530 --> 11:59.530
came to our Flower Street courtyard.

12:00.500 --> 12:02.450
In contrast to our cacophony,

12:02.800 --> 12:04.310
Siyi was quiet

12:04.350 --> 12:05.390
and headstrong.

12:05.460 --> 12:06.900
She also seemed troubled.

12:08.000 --> 12:10.340
At that time, we had no idea that

12:10.830 --> 12:12.310
this foreign-looking girl

12:12.330 --> 12:13.860
who doesn't talk much

12:14.430 --> 12:16.580
will eventually change our life.

12:23.460 --> 12:25.930
Want to see where you're sleeping?

12:25.970 --> 12:26.760
Come.

12:27.170 --> 12:27.890
Here.

12:29.830 --> 12:31.210
It's here.

12:31.320 --> 12:34.370
You'll sleep here with me at night.

12:35.830 --> 12:37.270
Look at your guitar case.

12:37.270 --> 12:38.550
Shall we put it here?

12:38.560 --> 12:39.110
Here.

12:39.880 --> 12:41.360
Yes, give it to me.

12:41.710 --> 12:42.620
Okay.

12:43.360 --> 12:44.190
Grandma.

12:45.410 --> 12:47.850
Will I be staying here from now on?

12:49.170 --> 12:51.810
What did your mother tell you?

12:51.890 --> 12:53.810
She said you're old,

12:53.820 --> 12:55.350
so she asked me to help take care of you.

12:56.070 --> 12:57.390
Exactly.

12:57.420 --> 12:58.900
I'm getting old,

12:58.940 --> 13:00.180
so I need you to take care of me.

13:00.200 --> 13:01.200
Isn't it?

13:01.230 --> 13:02.420
All's good.

13:03.190 --> 13:04.370
Look, there's a desk here.

13:04.430 --> 13:05.210
Come on.

13:05.620 --> 13:07.030
A desk for you.

13:08.660 --> 13:10.620
I prepared these for you.

13:10.870 --> 13:12.070
It comes with a chair.

13:12.070 --> 13:13.120
Sit here.

13:13.270 --> 13:14.670
Try it out.

13:15.000 --> 13:17.150
From now on, you'll do your homework here.

13:19.270 --> 13:20.340
Okay?

13:25.820 --> 13:27.720
Did she say for how long?

13:31.640 --> 13:33.530
Oh, let me show you the kitchen.

13:33.550 --> 13:34.730
There's a kitchen.

13:34.760 --> 13:37.290
Come, let me take you to the kitchen.

13:37.950 --> 13:38.810
Later,

13:38.840 --> 13:39.960
I'll make you some wontons.

13:40.040 --> 13:42.670
In the future, just tell me what you want to eat.

13:42.690 --> 13:44.150
I'll make it for you.

13:44.950 --> 13:46.060
The kitchen is over there.

13:48.230 --> 13:49.430
Here.

13:49.430 --> 13:51.990
Look, this is the kitchen.

14:03.880 --> 14:09.410
[News]

14:09.710 --> 14:10.590
Mom.

14:10.870 --> 14:11.840
Mom!

14:12.860 --> 14:13.610
Mom.

14:13.840 --> 14:14.860
What are we eating today?

14:14.990 --> 14:15.990
You.

14:15.990 --> 14:16.790
Listen,

14:16.830 --> 14:17.870
if you dare to steal watermelons again,

14:17.870 --> 14:18.870
I'll break your hand.

14:18.890 --> 14:19.430
Go.

14:19.460 --> 14:20.940
Borrow some onions from Aunt Liang.

14:24.030 --> 14:25.560
Aunt Liang, do you have onions?

14:25.590 --> 14:27.450
Yes, leek or spring onion?

14:27.620 --> 14:29.100
Mom, leek or spring onion?

14:29.620 --> 14:30.350
I'm cooking fish.

14:30.350 --> 14:31.750
What do you think?

14:31.790 --> 14:32.950
You didn't say you were cooking fish.

14:32.950 --> 14:34.190
Didn't you see what this is?

14:34.210 --> 14:35.600
Spring onion it is. Here.

14:41.770 --> 14:43.400
You don't even know what type of onion to get.

14:43.510 --> 14:44.670
Can you use your cleverness

14:44.670 --> 14:45.740
in your studies?

14:45.990 --> 14:46.910
How dare you steal from people?

14:46.950 --> 14:47.310
Grandma!

14:47.310 --> 14:48.110
Alright. Alright.

14:48.150 --> 14:49.740
Why are you yelling?

14:49.790 --> 14:51.450
I could hear you from far away.

14:52.210 --> 14:53.560
I'm not cooking these tonight.

14:53.720 --> 14:55.590
Share it with everyone when you're done.

14:55.630 --> 14:56.310
Okay, I'll do it.

14:56.310 --> 14:57.490
Thank you, Granny Ma.

14:57.530 --> 14:58.910
I'm going to Grandma's house to eat wontons.

14:58.910 --> 14:59.920
You're going to Grandma's house for dinner again?

14:59.950 --> 15:01.430
Alright. Let's go.

15:02.520 --> 15:03.480
Siyi!

15:03.770 --> 15:05.060
Siyi!

15:07.830 --> 15:09.430
Grandma's wontons are delicious.

15:09.460 --> 15:11.320
She made them for me every day when you were not around.

15:11.350 --> 15:12.640
Aren't they especially tasty?

15:16.990 --> 15:17.870
How old are you?

15:19.030 --> 15:20.020
I'm ten years old.

15:21.390 --> 15:22.520
Me too.

15:23.610 --> 15:24.940
You don't look like you're ten.

15:25.030 --> 15:26.780
You seem more mature than me.

15:26.940 --> 15:28.010
But maybe it's

15:28.070 --> 15:29.630
because you don't talk much.

15:30.220 --> 15:32.090
If I don't talk,

15:32.110 --> 15:34.230
would I look more mature?

15:34.270 --> 15:35.320
Alright.

15:35.750 --> 15:36.530
I think

15:36.550 --> 15:38.630
only these wontons can keep you quiet.

15:38.670 --> 15:41.000
You're so talkative.

15:44.270 --> 15:46.580
Granny Ma, please teach my mom when you're free.

15:46.670 --> 15:47.870
No matter what my mom cooks,

15:47.870 --> 15:49.190
it tastes like soy sauce.

15:50.190 --> 15:52.990
Your mother is the wife of a seafarer.

15:53.110 --> 15:54.720
She likes things with a strong flavor.

15:54.830 --> 15:55.990
Where are you from?

15:56.260 --> 15:57.270
Me?

15:57.270 --> 15:58.870
I'm from Shandong.

15:58.870 --> 16:00.390
Shandong, Linqing.

16:03.990 --> 16:06.070
Siyi's grandfather's ancestors

16:06.070 --> 16:07.230
were foreigners.

16:07.390 --> 16:08.690
Really?

16:09.100 --> 16:10.790
Why would I lie to you?

16:11.070 --> 16:11.590
Here.

16:11.630 --> 16:12.910
I have photos.

16:14.780 --> 16:15.990
Let's see...

16:16.790 --> 16:17.510
See?

16:17.550 --> 16:18.830
Aren't these people

16:18.950 --> 16:20.350
all foreigners?

16:20.350 --> 16:21.030
Right?

16:21.750 --> 16:24.070
This one is her grandpa.

16:27.070 --> 16:28.270
Am I right?

16:31.790 --> 16:33.020
Who is this?

16:33.380 --> 16:34.550
This is my dad.

16:34.590 --> 16:35.750
This is me.

16:36.270 --> 16:38.220
Your dad is so handsome.

16:38.590 --> 16:40.270
Big eyes and a high nose bridge.

16:40.270 --> 16:41.950
I knew it, you are a foreigner.

16:41.980 --> 16:43.590
I'm Chinese.

16:43.930 --> 16:45.970
Okay, Chinese.

16:47.230 --> 16:48.030
Grandma.

16:48.070 --> 16:49.710
Which country is Siyi's grandpa from?

16:50.710 --> 16:51.780
China.

16:51.810 --> 16:53.610
He was born in China.

16:53.640 --> 16:56.520
It's just that his ancestors were Italians.

16:57.430 --> 16:58.630
Where is Italy?

17:00.040 --> 17:01.840
I don't know either.

17:02.470 --> 17:03.950
Ask Grandpa Zhou when you have time.

17:03.990 --> 17:05.550
Grandpa Zhou must know.

17:05.589 --> 17:06.510
I only know

17:06.550 --> 17:08.670
Italy is very far away.

17:09.109 --> 17:10.220
Go back.

17:11.579 --> 17:12.849
Grandma, when we grow up,

17:12.910 --> 17:13.910
I'll drive a ship

17:13.910 --> 17:15.910
and take Siyi to Italy.

17:16.130 --> 17:17.109
You should come with us.

17:17.380 --> 17:18.109
Sure.

17:18.700 --> 17:19.790
I'll be waiting.

17:20.780 --> 17:21.390
Eat up.

17:23.869 --> 17:25.560
Siyi, eat quickly.

17:25.630 --> 17:27.530
I'll show you around the neighborhood later.

17:28.060 --> 17:28.830
Show me around?

17:33.310 --> 17:34.990
This is our courtyard.

17:35.700 --> 17:36.700
As you enter and turn right,

17:36.720 --> 17:37.920
the Zhou's occupy the first house.

17:38.110 --> 17:40.210
Grandpa Zhou is cultured.

17:40.240 --> 17:41.290
He's very nice.

17:43.090 --> 17:45.190
We hide at his house whenever we're in trouble.

17:46.200 --> 17:47.070
Grandpa Zhou!

17:49.550 --> 17:50.770
Fenghua.

17:50.830 --> 17:51.910
I know.

17:52.110 --> 17:54.560
You're here to eat again.

17:55.430 --> 17:55.990
No.

17:56.350 --> 17:57.160
No?

17:58.070 --> 18:00.540
This child is really good-looking.

18:01.150 --> 18:02.030
Her name is Ma Siyi,

18:02.030 --> 18:03.100
Granny Ma's granddaughter.

18:03.780 --> 18:04.900
-Siyi?
-Hello.

18:04.910 --> 18:05.440
Hello.

18:06.390 --> 18:07.590
You've grown so tall.

18:07.610 --> 18:08.690
Zhou Haikuo!

18:09.590 --> 18:10.590
Zhou Haikuo!

18:10.800 --> 18:12.820
You even know about this door?

18:15.720 --> 18:16.990
Grandpa Zhou's grandson

18:17.130 --> 18:18.040
is Zhou Haikuo.

18:18.070 --> 18:19.470
He is my classmate.

18:21.580 --> 18:22.870
He is a good student.

18:23.550 --> 18:25.470
If you want him to do your homework for you,

18:25.510 --> 18:26.310
just give him money.

18:26.460 --> 18:28.310
Fast and good, right?

18:30.350 --> 18:31.270
I see.

18:31.390 --> 18:33.430
You're doing people's homework for money?

18:33.670 --> 18:34.200
Grandpa,

18:34.200 --> 18:35.860
don't listen to them.

18:35.880 --> 18:37.990
I only let Wanghe copy my math homework twice.

18:38.010 --> 18:40.010
Grandpa Zhou, we're leaving.

18:41.190 --> 18:41.910
I didn't take any money.

18:41.910 --> 18:42.940
Uncle Zhou.

18:43.370 --> 18:44.240
Fenghua.

18:45.440 --> 18:47.500
Who is this doll?

18:48.190 --> 18:48.710
Ma Siyi,

18:48.750 --> 18:49.910
Granny Ma's granddaughter.

18:50.990 --> 18:51.710
Hello, Uncle.

18:51.790 --> 18:52.490
Hello.

18:52.980 --> 18:54.680
You can speak Chinese?

18:54.830 --> 18:56.060
Oh, yes.

18:56.390 --> 18:57.670
You're Granny Ma's granddaughter.

18:57.950 --> 18:58.880
Alright.

18:59.140 --> 19:00.630
I'm heading to the kitchen.

19:01.140 --> 19:02.210
Oh, right.

19:02.750 --> 19:05.070
Do visit my restaurant, By the Canal.

19:05.100 --> 19:06.380
I'll cook you something delicious.

19:06.620 --> 19:07.350
Okay?

19:07.390 --> 19:08.140
Bye.

19:09.600 --> 19:11.030
Uncle Zhou is a cook.

19:11.030 --> 19:12.420
He's a master of Huaiyang cuisine.

19:12.860 --> 19:15.240
He opened a restaurant called By the Canal.

19:15.800 --> 19:17.770
It's in the alley on Flower Street.

19:18.380 --> 19:20.300
Haikuo's mother performs Kun opera.

19:20.320 --> 19:22.130
She’s prettier than you.

19:25.380 --> 19:26.800
This is my home.

19:27.170 --> 19:28.720
My dad's Xia Lao'er,

19:28.830 --> 19:29.980
a seafarer.

19:30.270 --> 19:31.190
My mom is Li Yan.

19:31.190 --> 19:32.270
She runs a breakfast stall.

19:32.270 --> 19:33.500
You met her before.

19:33.960 --> 19:35.910
Is your mom good to you?

19:36.160 --> 19:37.960
No, she's always scolding me.

19:37.990 --> 19:38.830
She's super talkative.

19:38.900 --> 19:40.810
She'll suffocate if she's silent for three minutes.

19:41.070 --> 19:42.220
Who are you talking about?

19:42.280 --> 19:43.010
Run!

19:43.750 --> 19:44.790
You naughty kid!

19:44.790 --> 19:45.510
Aunt Liang!

19:45.550 --> 19:46.710
This is Aunt Liang's house.

19:46.710 --> 19:48.300
She runs the breakfast stall with my mum.

19:48.330 --> 19:49.430
Hello, Aunt Liang.

19:49.710 --> 19:50.870
Have you had dinner?

19:50.870 --> 19:52.080
Yes.

19:52.830 --> 19:53.590
Wanghe.

19:53.640 --> 19:54.710
Xie Wanghe!

19:54.830 --> 19:55.630
Xie Wanghe.

19:55.670 --> 19:56.350
Wanghe.

19:56.350 --> 19:57.440
Xie Wanghe!

19:58.150 --> 19:59.040
Xie Wanghe!

19:59.830 --> 20:00.390
What?

20:00.630 --> 20:01.870
I'm introducing Siyi to everyone.

20:01.910 --> 20:03.150
We're brothers from now on.

20:03.740 --> 20:06.480
Fenghua, who taught you to say that?

20:07.230 --> 20:07.950
Uncle Xie,

20:07.990 --> 20:08.990
Xie Wanghe's dad.

20:09.020 --> 20:10.480
My dad is Xie Tiancheng.

20:10.670 --> 20:12.430
He's the boss of the Flower Street portion of the Grand Canal.

20:12.430 --> 20:13.880
Everyone has to listen to him on the river.

20:13.890 --> 20:15.180
He's like the Dragon King.

20:15.990 --> 20:17.150
He's a seafarer with my dad.

20:17.230 --> 20:18.570
He makes a lot of money.

20:18.720 --> 20:19.910
Who told you that?

20:19.910 --> 20:20.940
My mom.

20:21.390 --> 20:22.570
He doesn't make that much money.

20:22.700 --> 20:23.830
If we really made money,

20:23.830 --> 20:25.560
we would have bought a house

20:25.590 --> 20:27.070
instead of renting from Granny Ma.

20:27.100 --> 20:28.220
Siyi, come with me.

20:28.300 --> 20:29.260
Don't hang out with her anymore.

20:29.310 --> 20:30.230
She is unreliable.

20:30.430 --> 20:32.570
A boy holding a girl's hand.

20:33.080 --> 20:34.070
Isn't that shameful?

20:34.240 --> 20:36.120
I'm afraid she'll get lost.

20:36.390 --> 20:37.300
Stay away from Wanghe.

20:37.350 --> 20:38.390
He's a bad kid.

20:38.390 --> 20:39.310
And you are a good kid?

20:40.430 --> 20:42.160
At least I'm not being punished by the teachers every day.

20:42.190 --> 20:43.230
Fenghua, you...

20:43.230 --> 20:44.260
Shao Xingchi!

20:44.750 --> 20:45.740
Let's go play!

20:46.080 --> 20:46.870
I'm not free today.

20:46.910 --> 20:47.670
I'm not going.

20:47.700 --> 20:48.190
No.

20:48.300 --> 20:49.640
Why are you cooking for yourself again?

20:49.670 --> 20:50.810
My mom is sick.

20:50.850 --> 20:52.350
Why is your mom always sick?

20:52.350 --> 20:53.740
Go away if you have nothing else to say.

20:54.070 --> 20:54.980
Xingchi,

20:55.150 --> 20:56.030
what did your dad teach you?

20:56.070 --> 20:57.310
You can't be this rude.

20:57.310 --> 20:58.670
Mom, eat it while it's hot.

20:58.790 --> 21:00.720
They are so annoying.

21:00.840 --> 21:01.930
Stop it.

21:02.010 --> 21:03.390
Auntie, what's wrong with you?

21:03.890 --> 21:04.890
I'm fine.

21:04.950 --> 21:06.830
My back is hurting again.

21:07.960 --> 21:09.130
Where is Uncle Shao?

21:10.150 --> 21:11.550
He probably got off work and is on his way.

21:11.550 --> 21:12.710
He hasn't come back yet.

21:13.230 --> 21:15.090
Do you need something?

21:15.320 --> 21:17.160
I'm here to introduce Siyi to everyone.

21:18.250 --> 21:19.410
Siyi.

21:19.430 --> 21:21.250
Come play with them whenever you're free.

21:24.910 --> 21:26.950
Uncle Shao works at the cultural museum.

21:26.950 --> 21:28.890
He's a writer who writes articles.

21:29.070 --> 21:30.620
He was even featured in the newspaper before.

21:30.910 --> 21:31.790
Don't play outside for too long.

21:31.830 --> 21:33.070
Your dad will be back soon.

21:34.750 --> 21:35.660
Siyi, let's go.

21:35.780 --> 21:36.470
Let's go stargazing.

21:36.510 --> 21:37.190
Look.

21:38.230 --> 21:38.950
Go that way.

21:39.510 --> 21:40.610
Haikuo!

21:40.630 --> 21:41.080
Haikuo!

21:41.100 --> 21:42.230
Haikuo!

21:42.260 --> 21:43.440
Haikuo!

21:43.460 --> 21:44.030
Haikuo!

21:44.050 --> 21:44.830
Haikuo!

21:44.830 --> 21:45.550
Here.

21:45.570 --> 21:47.220
Siyi, look.

22:08.900 --> 22:09.890
Dad.

22:10.270 --> 22:11.720
Why are you back so late?

22:11.840 --> 22:13.480
Did you drink again?

22:13.640 --> 22:14.880
Why would I drink?

22:14.920 --> 22:16.460
Why are you sitting there?

22:16.710 --> 22:17.510
Come down.

22:18.000 --> 22:19.050
Mr. Shao.

22:21.510 --> 22:22.390
Mr. Zhou.

22:22.420 --> 22:24.350
You had a drink again?

22:25.180 --> 22:26.830
I have something to tell you.

22:26.860 --> 22:28.280
Really? Come on.

22:31.470 --> 22:32.740
Mr. Zhou.

22:32.860 --> 22:35.450
I heard at the cultural museum today that

22:36.600 --> 22:38.720
Boss Xie is planning to change ships.

22:38.750 --> 22:40.120
Change ships?

22:41.020 --> 22:42.220
Isn't the current ship pretty new?

22:42.240 --> 22:42.890
Exactly.

22:42.920 --> 22:43.950
So why the need?

22:44.060 --> 22:45.350
How would I know?

22:45.830 --> 22:47.320
We all chipped in

22:47.350 --> 22:49.990
to help buy his current ship.

22:50.430 --> 22:51.670
It's only been a while

22:51.710 --> 22:52.620
and he wants to change the ship.

22:52.670 --> 22:53.990
What is he trying to do?

22:56.400 --> 22:58.280
Who told you that?

22:59.190 --> 23:00.750
I heard it from Zheng who sells antiques

23:00.790 --> 23:02.150
in front of our cultural museum.

23:02.810 --> 23:03.810
His son

23:03.990 --> 23:05.670
works in a shipyard.

23:05.700 --> 23:06.450
He said that

23:06.480 --> 23:08.800
Boss Xie has been negotiating with the shipyard people

23:08.840 --> 23:10.300
for several rounds now.

23:11.650 --> 23:13.610
You must talk to him about this.

23:13.630 --> 23:14.950
Don't let him do anything stupid.

23:14.990 --> 23:16.020
You...

23:16.040 --> 23:17.630
Don't worry. It's fine.

23:17.650 --> 23:18.700
When he comes back tomorrow,

23:18.730 --> 23:20.420
I'll ask him about the details.

23:20.860 --> 23:22.280
Tiancheng

23:22.350 --> 23:23.700
is meticulous.

23:24.270 --> 23:26.030
He won't do anything reckless.

23:26.580 --> 23:27.350
Don't worry.

23:27.350 --> 23:29.880
You have to talk to him tomorrow.

23:30.270 --> 23:30.790
Okay.

23:31.020 --> 23:31.920
I'm leaving, Mr. Zhou.

23:31.990 --> 23:32.270
Okay.

23:32.270 --> 23:32.840
Take care.

23:32.890 --> 23:33.240
Okay.

23:33.240 --> 23:33.950
Will you be fine?

23:33.990 --> 23:34.470
No problem.

23:34.510 --> 23:36.070
Okay, take care.

23:38.230 --> 23:38.790
Xingchi.

23:40.070 --> 23:41.280
What time is it now?

23:41.410 --> 23:42.250
Go home now!

23:42.510 --> 23:43.230
Have you finished your homework?

23:43.230 --> 23:44.470
I'll be back later.

23:44.510 --> 23:45.190
Okay.

23:45.550 --> 23:46.950
Why are you laughing?

23:46.950 --> 23:48.230
Have you finished your homework?

23:48.230 --> 23:49.540
Yes.

23:49.700 --> 23:51.350
Can you stop drinking?

23:51.380 --> 23:52.830
When did I drink?

23:53.350 --> 23:54.310
Wanghe!

23:54.900 --> 23:57.290
Look at the time. Don't you know when to stop?

23:57.590 --> 23:58.510
Let's go home.

23:58.020 --> 24:00.160
♫When the moon hangs in the sky♫

23:58.550 --> 23:59.520
Siyi.

23:59.910 --> 24:01.640
She just got here and you're already dragging her along.

24:00.680 --> 24:02.420
♫And it's cooling in the yard♫

24:01.830 --> 24:03.520
Time for bed.

24:03.100 --> 24:06.670
♫Who is still by your side?♫

24:03.800 --> 24:04.470
Hurry up

24:04.830 --> 24:05.480
Yan!

24:05.510 --> 24:07.350
Take Fenghua home to rest.

24:07.350 --> 24:08.270
It's late.

24:07.680 --> 24:11.430
♫As time passes♫

24:08.310 --> 24:09.820
I'm not sleepy yet. Let me play some more.

24:09.950 --> 24:11.550
You should behave more like a big brother.

24:11.800 --> 24:13.100
Don't you know when to stop playing?

24:11.940 --> 24:15.720
♫Is a lifetime really that long?♫

24:13.740 --> 24:14.990
Do I have to tell you what to do?

24:14.990 --> 24:17.270
Do you need to be scolded to be good?

24:19.180 --> 24:21.190
♫When youthful company fades♫

24:21.760 --> 24:23.750
♫Leaving only small talk and pleasantries♫

24:24.350 --> 24:27.970
♫Spring feels short, while autumn lingers♫

24:29.000 --> 24:32.570
♫A gentle breeze carries dreams away♫

24:33.520 --> 24:37.590
♫Dreamland and dreams♫

24:35.600 --> 24:39.620
[Welcome]

24:37.720 --> 24:38.430
Boss!

24:38.550 --> 24:39.500
You're back!

24:39.870 --> 24:40.710
Let's have a drink sometime!

24:40.750 --> 24:41.680
Sure thing.

24:41.790 --> 24:44.150
I'll order thirty more packs of instant noodles from you.

24:44.230 --> 24:44.710
Alright.

24:44.950 --> 24:45.760
Got it.

24:50.990 --> 24:51.830
Si!

24:52.050 --> 24:52.810
Come here!

24:55.660 --> 24:56.530
Take it.

24:56.660 --> 24:57.280
Okay.

25:00.430 --> 25:01.450
Xia!

25:01.570 --> 25:02.110
Let's go.

25:02.110 --> 25:02.780
Let's go.

25:02.830 --> 25:04.020
Okay. Come again.

25:11.210 --> 25:12.020
Will do.

25:12.580 --> 25:14.470
The kids will be so happy to see us back.

25:14.500 --> 25:15.140
Definitely!

25:15.160 --> 25:16.060
Look at this puppy.

25:18.620 --> 25:20.110
You must have made quite a bit on this trip, right?

25:20.130 --> 25:21.600
Here, have some fresh water chestnuts.

25:22.530 --> 25:23.440
These are really fresh.

25:23.470 --> 25:23.840
Of course.

25:23.870 --> 25:25.420
Only the best for our children.

25:26.390 --> 25:27.910
Boss, please consider my son.

25:27.910 --> 25:28.790
He's graduating next year.

25:28.790 --> 25:30.640
Can he join and work for you?

25:30.870 --> 25:31.670
Sure.

25:31.740 --> 25:32.930
Leave your son to me.

25:32.970 --> 25:34.090
Thank you, Boss Xie.

25:34.110 --> 25:35.340
Take my son along to see the world too.

25:35.430 --> 25:37.750
Your son is not even a month old yet.

25:37.750 --> 25:38.640
You... Fine, fine.

25:40.350 --> 25:41.620
I've already split them into stacks.

25:41.660 --> 25:43.370
It's all in this bag.

25:43.790 --> 25:44.190
Okay.

25:44.190 --> 25:45.350
I'll leave this matter to you.

25:45.390 --> 25:46.050
Okay.

25:47.340 --> 25:49.030
In my opinion, the canal

25:49.050 --> 25:50.890
is a main pillar of transportation.

25:50.920 --> 25:52.160
There was a ship

25:52.180 --> 25:53.750
carrying foreigners.

25:53.780 --> 25:55.390
It was called Little Polo.

25:55.770 --> 25:56.730
It carried Italians.

25:56.760 --> 25:58.600
More than 100 years ago,

25:58.710 --> 26:00.470
Flower Street might not have existed.

26:00.510 --> 26:01.600
Look at you.

26:01.670 --> 26:02.270
Ask...

26:02.310 --> 26:03.150
Ask Mr. Shao.

26:03.150 --> 26:05.050
I can testify.

26:05.230 --> 26:06.250
See?

26:07.550 --> 26:08.470
See what I said?

26:08.510 --> 26:10.270
I said the ship must have sunk here.

26:10.650 --> 26:12.090
Little Polo must have been

26:12.120 --> 26:13.250
related to her.

26:13.470 --> 26:15.260
Is he talking about that ship again?

26:15.350 --> 26:15.830
Yes.

26:15.830 --> 26:17.150
He's obsessed.

26:21.180 --> 26:22.330
Shao Xingchi.

26:22.660 --> 26:24.220
Look at him.

26:25.180 --> 26:26.210
Come on.

26:26.680 --> 26:27.570
Come on.

26:27.930 --> 26:29.170
Is she your granddaughter?

26:29.260 --> 26:30.080
Yes.

26:31.450 --> 26:33.310
Fenghua! Stop!

26:33.470 --> 26:34.490
I'll beat you!

26:34.580 --> 26:35.590
Give it to me.

26:35.590 --> 26:37.340
Enough.

26:38.310 --> 26:39.470
Are you not performing today?

26:39.550 --> 26:39.990
Yes.

26:40.010 --> 26:42.010
I took time off to come back.

26:42.050 --> 26:43.200
The restaurant has gotten busy.

26:43.270 --> 26:44.610
If I don't come back,

26:44.630 --> 26:45.950
Yanlin will quarrel with me.

26:46.230 --> 26:47.270
He wouldn't dare.

26:47.630 --> 26:49.830
It's not that. Our son misses her.

26:50.340 --> 26:51.260
That's true.

26:53.670 --> 26:55.290
Are you playing with Grandpa?

26:57.380 --> 26:58.750
Why are you so wet?

27:01.220 --> 27:02.110
Who is this girl?

27:02.110 --> 27:02.510
Siyi.

27:02.550 --> 27:03.510
Ma Siyi.

27:04.020 --> 27:05.680
-Granny Ma's granddaughter.
-Granny Ma's granddaughter.

27:06.050 --> 27:06.880
You're here.

27:07.470 --> 27:09.340
How nice. You're so pretty.

27:09.990 --> 27:10.670
You're back.

27:10.710 --> 27:12.150
Everyone is here!

27:14.750 --> 27:16.070
Long time no see.

27:17.030 --> 27:19.280
Let me report to you.

27:19.410 --> 27:20.660
This time,

27:20.680 --> 27:22.880
This seafaring trip with Xia and I

27:22.910 --> 27:24.300
earned us...

27:24.450 --> 27:25.920
24,000 yuan!

27:31.040 --> 27:32.570
As usual,

27:32.600 --> 27:33.920
half the money is mine.

27:33.950 --> 27:35.590
As for the rest,

27:35.610 --> 27:36.980
it will be divided

27:37.010 --> 27:38.250
according to your shares, okay?

27:38.280 --> 27:39.650
Okay!

27:39.830 --> 27:40.550
Xia!

27:40.590 --> 27:41.430
Split the money!

27:41.460 --> 27:42.900
Okay.

27:45.580 --> 27:46.780
This looks pretty cool.

27:47.680 --> 27:49.510
His mother bought it for him.

27:49.980 --> 27:50.710
That seems advanced.

27:50.740 --> 27:51.450
Thank you.

27:51.480 --> 27:52.710
That seems really advanced.

28:00.960 --> 28:01.760
I have a suggestion.

28:01.790 --> 28:03.870
Since we have this new gadget,

28:03.900 --> 28:06.020
why don't we take a photo?

28:06.050 --> 28:07.320
Okay?

28:08.340 --> 28:09.590
I can do it myself.

28:09.630 --> 28:10.970
He even has a temper.

28:11.320 --> 28:12.970
This is amazing.

28:12.990 --> 28:15.020
Haikuo, come on.

28:15.060 --> 28:15.820
Come on.

28:15.840 --> 28:18.600
One, two, three.

28:18.670 --> 28:20.400
Cheese!

28:24.020 --> 28:25.550
Happy holidays!

28:25.550 --> 28:26.870
Happy holidays!

28:27.100 --> 28:29.270
Happy holidays!

28:30.160 --> 28:30.870
Don't kick up a fuss.

28:30.870 --> 28:31.390
Go have dinner.

28:31.430 --> 28:31.960
Hurry up.

28:31.960 --> 28:33.190
Hurry up.

28:33.230 --> 28:34.310
Let's eat.

28:34.310 --> 28:35.710
The dishes are getting cold.

28:36.250 --> 28:38.580
Since everyone is here,

28:38.600 --> 28:41.950
I want to discuss something major with you.

28:42.830 --> 28:43.640
Do you all know?

28:43.660 --> 28:46.880
Recently, construction is happening all over the country.

28:47.070 --> 28:48.760
The demand for transportation of materials

28:48.800 --> 28:49.870
is rising every day.

28:49.900 --> 28:53.050
And transportation fees keep rising.

28:54.100 --> 28:57.080
I think our 500-ton ship

28:57.490 --> 28:58.730
is not big enough

28:58.760 --> 29:00.090
to meet transportation demands.

29:00.180 --> 29:01.800
Look at the 1,000-ton ships.

29:01.830 --> 29:02.550
We have to make two trips

29:02.580 --> 29:03.750
to match their single trip.

29:03.780 --> 29:07.120
And the fuel costs aren't that different.

29:07.140 --> 29:07.580
Right?

29:07.620 --> 29:09.030
More critically, we are wasting time.

29:09.050 --> 29:10.930
We're wasting time, isn't it?

29:10.960 --> 29:12.480
So I think

29:12.500 --> 29:14.070
now

29:14.100 --> 29:17.790
is the best time to change ships.

29:18.100 --> 29:19.720
This is what I'm thinking.

29:19.740 --> 29:22.420
We'll sell the old

29:22.440 --> 29:23.500
500-ton ship

29:23.530 --> 29:25.770
and top up 300,000 yuan

29:25.790 --> 29:28.430
to get the 1000-ton ship.

29:28.820 --> 29:30.460
Our common account

29:30.490 --> 29:32.170
currently has

29:32.270 --> 29:33.280
200,000 yuan.

29:33.320 --> 29:34.210
So,

29:34.720 --> 29:36.170
we still need 100,000 yuan.

29:38.130 --> 29:40.460
100,000 yuan is not a small amount.

29:40.560 --> 29:41.520
Of course.

29:41.540 --> 29:42.150
Why are you poking me?

29:42.180 --> 29:43.290
Do you have 100,000 yuan?

29:43.310 --> 29:45.070
Of course, I know 100,000 yuan

29:45.230 --> 29:46.570
is a big amount.

29:46.750 --> 29:49.230
But I did a rough estimate.

29:49.850 --> 29:52.670
After we get the 1,000-ton ship,

29:53.160 --> 29:55.100
we'll definitely break even

29:55.130 --> 29:56.340
if we work hard for two years.

29:56.360 --> 29:57.440
The rest

29:57.470 --> 29:58.350
will be...

29:58.370 --> 29:59.050
Pure profit.

29:59.270 --> 30:00.120
Pure profit.

30:00.140 --> 30:00.770
Right.

30:03.230 --> 30:05.010
Boss, I think we should...

30:05.270 --> 30:07.640
discuss this matter a bit more.

30:07.770 --> 30:08.980
The Beijing-Shanghai Expressway

30:09.180 --> 30:12.060
will be completed at the end of the year.

30:12.210 --> 30:13.870
I'm just a little worried that

30:13.890 --> 30:17.540
our canal's traffic may be affected.

30:17.710 --> 30:19.060
It's best to be more careful.

30:19.100 --> 30:19.940
About that,

30:19.960 --> 30:22.250
I did a thorough research.

30:23.300 --> 30:26.070
The queue for buildings above 20 floors

30:26.450 --> 30:29.870
has been lined up till 2008.

30:29.900 --> 30:31.880
I know that highway transportation

30:31.910 --> 30:33.430
is much faster.

30:33.440 --> 30:34.920
But it costs a lot.

30:34.960 --> 30:36.400
We just need to focus on

30:36.420 --> 30:38.220
the Honghuai transportation route

30:38.480 --> 30:40.840
to make a small fortune.

30:41.400 --> 30:41.960
Right?

30:41.980 --> 30:42.660
Yes.

30:42.860 --> 30:44.910
Jiangnan Shipyard has enough orders

30:44.930 --> 30:46.330
lined up for the next two years.

30:46.360 --> 30:47.160
See?

30:47.850 --> 30:48.360
But the problem is...

30:48.400 --> 30:49.470
Enough.

30:49.830 --> 30:51.830
If you don't want to do it, withdraw your shares.

30:52.170 --> 30:53.700
I'll cover the rest.

30:53.730 --> 30:54.950
Don’t say that.

30:54.990 --> 30:57.280
I didn't say I want to withdraw my shares.

31:01.860 --> 31:03.220
Let me tell you.

31:03.980 --> 31:05.230
The canal

31:05.260 --> 31:06.980
raised us.

31:07.350 --> 31:09.120
We must not forget our origins.

31:11.080 --> 31:12.050
Mr. Zhou.

31:12.110 --> 31:13.110
I'll go.

31:13.260 --> 31:14.040
No, Mr. Zhou.

31:14.070 --> 31:16.140
Yanlin was just looking out for us.

31:22.550 --> 31:23.620
Let's drink.

31:23.650 --> 31:24.700
Come on.

31:24.720 --> 31:25.360
Come.

31:48.470 --> 31:49.750
Let's soak your feet.

31:59.240 --> 31:59.940
Slowly.

32:02.790 --> 32:03.920
I can do it myself.

32:03.950 --> 32:04.710
I can do it myself.

32:13.110 --> 32:15.800
Changing ships is a big deal.

32:17.550 --> 32:18.960
Don't do anything reckless.

32:19.060 --> 32:20.540
I don't care about others.

32:20.800 --> 32:22.060
But Granny Ma

32:22.130 --> 32:24.250
is raising her granddaughter alone.

32:25.160 --> 32:26.680
If we lose money,

32:26.990 --> 32:28.150
even if it means we have to pay,

32:28.190 --> 32:30.030
we can't let their family suffer a loss.

32:30.070 --> 32:32.340
Why don't you have any faith in me?

32:32.650 --> 32:33.350
No...

32:33.380 --> 32:34.520
What are you talking about

32:34.590 --> 32:36.390
after listening to others?

32:36.410 --> 32:37.900
Have I ever lost money in business?

32:38.110 --> 32:39.020
Have I?

32:39.240 --> 32:41.000
Let's talk about this ship.

32:41.520 --> 32:42.880
Since I bought it,

32:42.920 --> 32:43.960
did I lose any money?

32:44.180 --> 32:45.780
Haven't I been leading everyone

32:45.810 --> 32:47.470
on a steady path towards prosperity?

32:47.500 --> 32:49.260
Think about how much they profited too.

32:49.870 --> 32:51.800
You're worried for nothing.

32:51.970 --> 32:53.180
Let's decide

32:53.200 --> 32:55.920
after everyone has come to a consensus.

32:57.560 --> 33:00.480
Do you know how much it costs to drive

33:00.630 --> 33:02.200
a truck on the highway?

33:03.460 --> 33:05.210
You have to pay for the bridge.

33:05.640 --> 33:07.370
You have to pay for the road.

33:07.400 --> 33:08.560
If you enter the city,

33:08.580 --> 33:09.990
you have to pay the parking fee.

33:10.020 --> 33:11.430
How much will it cost?

33:12.520 --> 33:14.110
These are all free

33:14.130 --> 33:15.560
on the canal.

33:16.320 --> 33:17.330
I don't understand.

33:17.370 --> 33:18.700
What's wrong?

33:19.250 --> 33:21.540
What's with the attitude?

33:33.900 --> 33:36.070
Have you lost some weight lately?

33:37.710 --> 33:38.390
No.

33:38.430 --> 33:39.870
You don't feel as full as before.

33:40.790 --> 33:42.470
I think I gained weight though. Feel it.

33:42.510 --> 33:44.290
Nonsense, that's your ribs.

33:44.330 --> 33:45.680
Where am I supposed to feel?

33:45.700 --> 33:46.970
Here, feel down here.

33:47.690 --> 33:49.010
We have to check

33:49.160 --> 33:50.700
your body thoroughly tonight.

33:50.730 --> 33:51.830
Look at my waist.

34:01.420 --> 34:02.590
What time is it?

34:02.620 --> 34:03.430
Still fooling around?

34:05.830 --> 34:06.550
Wanghe.

34:07.430 --> 34:08.340
Let me ask you something.

34:12.110 --> 34:13.510
How much is one jin of watermelon now?

34:13.530 --> 34:14.400
25 cents.

34:14.409 --> 34:15.100
No, 26 cents.

34:15.139 --> 34:16.139
It has risen recently.

34:16.750 --> 34:17.760
So can't our family

34:18.340 --> 34:19.420
afford it

34:19.449 --> 34:20.489
or something?

34:21.760 --> 34:23.210
How dare you

34:23.239 --> 34:25.159
steal from the ship?

34:25.179 --> 34:26.179
Why are you hitting me?

34:26.210 --> 34:28.219
You stole things when you were young too.

34:28.239 --> 34:29.670
What did I steal?

34:29.710 --> 34:30.630
You stole sweet potatoes

34:30.650 --> 34:31.409
and chives.

34:31.440 --> 34:33.030
You stole whatever was in the field.

34:33.060 --> 34:34.100
Who told you that?

34:34.130 --> 34:35.639
Granny told me that!

34:39.239 --> 34:40.760
Why bring this up with your dad?

34:40.780 --> 34:42.179
You still want to...

34:42.199 --> 34:44.469
How dare you talk back?

34:44.510 --> 34:46.389
How dare you talk back?

34:46.630 --> 34:47.840
I'll kill you!

34:47.929 --> 34:48.590
Stop!

34:48.610 --> 34:49.340
You can't hit me.

34:49.360 --> 34:50.550
How dare you talk back?

34:50.590 --> 34:51.650
Mom!

34:51.690 --> 34:54.210
Mom, Wanghe is getting beaten again!

34:54.560 --> 34:56.210
Do you know why his father is beating him?

34:56.230 --> 34:57.440
He stole watermelons.

34:57.480 --> 34:58.480
What about you?

34:58.510 --> 35:00.150
You stole them too, don't you know?

35:01.280 --> 35:01.940
Enough.

35:01.940 --> 35:02.550
Listen to me.

35:02.590 --> 35:03.550
Enough.

35:03.620 --> 35:04.460
I'll beat you.

35:04.830 --> 35:05.670
Alright, alright.

35:05.710 --> 35:06.430
Why are you hiding?

35:06.470 --> 35:07.720
Stand still.

35:08.310 --> 35:09.510
In just one essay,

35:09.530 --> 35:10.960
you have over ten wrongly written characters.

35:10.990 --> 35:12.800
Your handwriting is atrocious.

35:12.810 --> 35:14.170
You even misused idioms.

35:14.210 --> 35:16.190
Are you trying to piss me off?

35:16.470 --> 35:18.400
Don't yell at him.

35:20.160 --> 35:21.770
If you feel uncomfortable,

35:22.240 --> 35:23.750
we can withdraw our shares.

35:23.790 --> 35:25.780
I'll go talk to Haihong about it, okay?

35:26.060 --> 35:26.900
Don't withdraw it.

35:28.640 --> 35:29.740
Why?

35:29.770 --> 35:31.510
Our pride's on the line, that's why.

35:31.580 --> 35:32.540
No one else is withdrawing.

35:32.630 --> 35:33.750
If I withdraw now,

35:33.780 --> 35:35.180
what will people think of me if this gets out?

35:35.330 --> 35:37.010
Wouldn't I look petty?

35:37.140 --> 35:38.060
So you know that too.

35:38.100 --> 35:39.420
What do I not know?

35:41.490 --> 35:42.610
Let me tell you.

35:42.640 --> 35:44.520
People are social creatures.

35:44.530 --> 35:46.930
No other creature is more sociable than us.

35:47.590 --> 35:48.560
That's why even when

35:48.590 --> 35:49.830
an individual clearly knows

35:49.860 --> 35:52.060
the group is making a wrong decision,

35:52.080 --> 35:54.550
in order to not be isolated from the group,

35:54.590 --> 35:55.910
it is forced

35:55.930 --> 35:58.450
to follow the group's wrong decision.

35:58.470 --> 35:59.760
For example, the Second World War.

35:59.780 --> 36:00.930
So many people were

36:00.970 --> 36:02.730
against the war.

36:02.750 --> 36:04.460
But if you throw them in Germany,

36:04.620 --> 36:06.620
would they dare to speak up against the war?

36:07.560 --> 36:09.560
They would be thrown into a concentration camp!

36:09.690 --> 36:10.770
Let's still withdraw.

36:10.790 --> 36:11.590
I'll go talk to them.

36:13.030 --> 36:14.460
Come back.

36:17.440 --> 36:19.160
I'll be join in this round, okay?

36:19.190 --> 36:20.510
I'll stop.

36:21.260 --> 36:22.620
It feels like someone forced you.

36:22.660 --> 36:23.340
No.

36:23.360 --> 36:24.480
No one forced me.

36:24.520 --> 36:26.000
I did it willingly.

36:32.880 --> 36:34.030
What are you looking at?

36:35.310 --> 36:36.550
Have you reflected on yourself?

36:38.590 --> 36:39.800
I confess.

36:40.510 --> 36:41.610
This was written

36:42.160 --> 36:43.360
by Haikuo.

36:45.910 --> 36:48.450
I even bought him three sticks of ice cream.

36:48.490 --> 36:49.380
I kept it a secret.

36:51.350 --> 36:53.500
How dare you do this?

36:53.690 --> 36:55.540
Was that beating too light?

36:56.190 --> 36:56.710
Help!

36:56.710 --> 36:57.400
Stop!

36:57.420 --> 36:58.070
Granny Ma!

36:58.110 --> 36:58.830
You naughty brat!

36:58.870 --> 36:59.430
Stop!

36:59.470 --> 37:00.330
Help!

37:00.900 --> 37:01.620
Haikuo!

37:01.640 --> 37:03.150
Damn you!

37:06.010 --> 37:07.660
Are you really changing the ship?

37:10.650 --> 37:12.890
He said we can make more money with a bigger one.

37:12.930 --> 37:13.930
Why not?

37:14.300 --> 37:16.050
Is there that much demand?

37:17.510 --> 37:18.650
He said yes.

37:19.470 --> 37:21.310
What do you think?

37:23.310 --> 37:24.470
I'm just his lackey.

37:24.470 --> 37:26.150
Why should I care so much?

37:26.730 --> 37:28.370
He said it, so he must be right.

37:28.670 --> 37:30.700
You've worked with him for so many years.

37:30.740 --> 37:32.500
Don't you know anything?

37:32.650 --> 37:33.550
You're a man

37:33.580 --> 37:35.180
but you have no opinion of your own.

37:35.210 --> 37:36.440
What a loser.

37:40.380 --> 37:42.480
Of course I have my own opinions.

37:42.520 --> 37:44.030
It was my idea and opinion

37:44.440 --> 37:46.040
to marry you back then.

37:46.070 --> 37:46.950
So many people opposed it.

37:46.950 --> 37:48.540
I didn't listen to any of them.

37:49.160 --> 37:50.470
Who opposed it?

37:50.870 --> 37:51.730
Your mother?

37:51.870 --> 37:53.550
Your third uncle, or your fourth aunt?

37:55.710 --> 37:57.830
Listen, Xia Lao'er.

37:58.660 --> 38:00.190
You had no house and no car.

38:00.230 --> 38:01.660
It's a blessing to your family

38:01.690 --> 38:02.920
that a pure maiden like me

38:02.940 --> 38:04.930
married you.

38:11.200 --> 38:13.520
You claim you're the good fortune of our family,

38:13.560 --> 38:15.120
but that's just your opinion.

38:17.810 --> 38:19.150
Xia Lao'er!

38:20.080 --> 38:21.180
We agreed not to fight!

38:21.210 --> 38:21.970
Stop!

38:22.100 --> 38:23.150
Xia Lao'er, don't run!

38:23.170 --> 38:24.820
Explain yourself!

38:25.220 --> 38:26.540
You always hit me!

38:26.560 --> 38:28.350
I can't explain anything to you!

38:28.390 --> 38:30.750
Xia Lao'er, are you really leaving?

38:31.030 --> 38:32.400
Come back here!

38:32.860 --> 38:34.770
Xia Lao'er, you bastard!

38:35.930 --> 38:37.790
How dare you say such things!

38:41.700 --> 38:43.330
What are you laughing at?

38:43.930 --> 38:46.920
I'm watching the videos Haikuo took during the day.

38:47.500 --> 38:48.620
It's so fun.

38:49.650 --> 38:50.680
Seriously.

38:51.100 --> 38:52.710
You said such off-putting words

38:52.900 --> 38:54.640
in front of so many people.

38:54.740 --> 38:56.410
How can Dad be happy about it?

38:56.960 --> 38:58.520
It's my fault.

38:58.920 --> 38:59.650
Let me tell you.

38:59.670 --> 39:01.670
Dad's feelings for the canal

39:01.700 --> 39:02.980
is not the same as ours.

39:03.400 --> 39:05.120
We can invest

39:05.590 --> 39:06.750
in that new ship.

39:07.230 --> 39:09.000
It's not a big sum of money anyway.

39:09.190 --> 39:10.230
It's fine if we make a loss.

39:10.260 --> 39:11.700
As long as my dad is happy.

39:11.720 --> 39:12.880
Make a loss?

39:13.180 --> 39:14.530
Will he be okay with that?

39:14.750 --> 39:15.990
Seriously.

39:16.040 --> 39:17.210
All my dad

39:17.270 --> 39:19.440
cares about is the prosperity of the canal.

39:19.470 --> 39:20.740
He doesn't care about money.

39:20.800 --> 39:22.780
Think about it. He prospered

39:22.830 --> 39:23.730
and suffered before.

39:23.750 --> 39:24.700
He's been through ups and downs.

39:24.730 --> 39:26.950
Nothing really fazes him anymore.

39:27.930 --> 39:31.620
Given that every family has to chip in for the new ship,

39:32.320 --> 39:34.390
do you think Granny Ma still has money?

39:36.630 --> 39:37.660
You're right.

39:37.690 --> 39:39.140
She spent her all savings

39:39.160 --> 39:41.090
on her son's medical bills.

39:41.130 --> 39:42.600
But he still died.

39:42.630 --> 39:44.360
At this age,

39:44.380 --> 39:45.540
she still has to raise her granddaughter.

39:45.810 --> 39:47.970
It must be hard to get by.

40:07.630 --> 40:09.650
What's wrong, Siyi?

40:09.670 --> 40:11.040
Can't sleep?

40:11.950 --> 40:13.240
I'm thinking about things.

40:15.040 --> 40:16.900
At such a young age?

40:16.930 --> 40:18.300
What are you thinking about?

40:20.750 --> 40:23.630
Our ancestors were Italians.

40:23.750 --> 40:25.830
It was chaotic back then.

40:25.850 --> 40:27.490
Why did they come to China?

40:27.520 --> 40:29.570
Wasn't it better to stay at home?

40:32.430 --> 40:33.110
Okay.

40:33.550 --> 40:34.480
Come.

40:34.510 --> 40:36.190
Come to me.

40:36.300 --> 40:37.720
Let me tell you

40:37.750 --> 40:40.020
about your family.

40:41.390 --> 40:44.800
Your grandpa told me this story.

40:45.380 --> 40:46.890
He said that

40:46.920 --> 40:50.100
his grandfather

40:50.220 --> 40:53.180
was named Marford.

40:53.250 --> 40:55.140
He was indeed an Italian.

40:56.230 --> 40:57.400
During the war,

40:57.430 --> 41:00.580
in order to protect his wife and children,

41:00.620 --> 41:03.060
he stabbed the Japanese

41:03.090 --> 41:05.810
and killed two of them.

41:06.400 --> 41:07.320
But later,

41:07.350 --> 41:09.360
the Japanese released hounds

41:09.380 --> 41:11.250
to attack him.

41:11.280 --> 41:13.070
He was badly wounded.

41:13.380 --> 41:15.260
Before he died,

41:15.270 --> 41:16.920
he told his son

41:17.310 --> 41:18.580
that

41:18.620 --> 41:20.300
his brother

41:20.670 --> 41:22.800
was coming from Italy to see him.

41:23.860 --> 41:27.110
He was on a ship on the canal,

41:27.340 --> 41:29.100
cruising northwards.

41:30.150 --> 41:31.910
He asked your great-grandfather

41:32.460 --> 41:34.780
to find his brother no matter what.

41:36.130 --> 41:37.670
Since then,

41:39.090 --> 41:42.760
your great-grandpa led the family

41:44.420 --> 41:47.500
to head southwards.

41:48.970 --> 41:51.410
When he reached Linqing,

41:52.040 --> 41:54.390
your grandpa married me.

41:54.950 --> 41:59.340
I then followed him to continue further south.

42:00.250 --> 42:02.010
So we ended up here

42:02.040 --> 42:04.010
at Flower Street.

42:05.330 --> 42:06.570
Later,

42:07.310 --> 42:11.320
our Ma family settled here on Flower Street.

42:13.090 --> 42:14.970
What about the person Grandpa was looking for?

42:15.070 --> 42:16.110
Have you found him?

42:20.180 --> 42:22.040
It's been too many years.

42:23.540 --> 42:24.860
We can't find him anymore.

42:27.490 --> 42:30.280
So what if we found him?

42:30.700 --> 42:32.770
That's how people are.

42:34.220 --> 42:36.190
We all have feelings.

42:37.160 --> 42:38.970
Just like our courtyard.

42:39.520 --> 42:41.500
Look at the neighbors.

42:42.100 --> 42:46.090
We respect, care for and support one another.

42:46.250 --> 42:49.170
We aren't relatives, but we're closer than relatives.

42:50.390 --> 42:52.490
Some blood relatives

42:52.860 --> 42:54.710
don't contact each other for a long time.

42:55.380 --> 42:58.250
Gradually, the relationship fades.

42:59.780 --> 43:01.660
Just like my mom and I.
